		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Copper and brass wind-up automaton inset with a gem. Follows orders relentlessly.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +3 (1d6) or 1 gem +7, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Clockwork</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. Immune to damage from fire, cold, or non-magical sources. Double damage from electricity.</p><p></p><p><strong>Gem</strong>. Each mage has one gem (wand). Roll 1d4: 1. Magic missile, 2. Acid arrow, 3.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lightning bolt, 4</strong>. Fireball.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
